sequenceDiagram
  participant Op as Operator
  participant Cfg as Configuration
  participant App as Application
  participant Tel as Telemetry log
  Op->>Cfg: set activated model (after acceptance)
  Op->>App: run bounded smoke (ceiling enforced)
  App->>Tel: append row {caseId, servedBy}
  Op->>Tel: assert serving model
  Tel-->>Op: observed identities + row count
  alt empty log
    Tel-->>Op: not confirmed (absence is not evidence)
  end
  alt mismatch or kill switch engaged
    Op->>Cfg: revert to retained rollback target
    Note over Cfg,App: configuration change,<br/>no code release
  end
